/articleshow/129985261.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/make-a-deal-before-its-too-late-trump-warns-iran-shares-video-of-karaj-bridge-tumbling-down/articleshow/129985261.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-02T23:01:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129985917,imgsize-4336180.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Fact check: Is IShowSpeed having a baby? Truth behind Viral livestream claim about daughter and quitting YouTube]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129990161.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[IShowSpeed is not having a baby. Darren Watkins Jr played an April Fool’s prank where he pretended to be a father and quit YouTube. The livestream looked real, but he later revealed it was fake by dropping a baby doll. His friend Slipz also joined the prank, making fans believe false updates for a short time.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/fact-check-is-ishowspeed-having-a-baby-truth-behind-viral-livestream-claim-about-daughter-and-quitting-youtube/articleshow/129990161.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/fact-check-is-ishowspeed-having-a-baby-truth-behind-viral-livestream-claim-about-daughter-and-quitting-youtube/articleshow/129990161.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-03T03:40:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129989936,imgsize-1239253.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Clavicular suddenly ends livestream leaving fans worried as illness revealed amid ongoing investigation rumors and growing past controversies]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129988819.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Braden Eric Peters, known as Clavicular, ended his livestream early due to illness, not legal trouble. Fans had feared something serious because of his past controversies. Sources confirmed he had flu-like symptoms. While he faces ongoing legal and public scrutiny, there is no official update linking the livestream incident to any investigation or enforcement action at this time.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/clavicular-suddenly-ends-livestream-leaving-fans-worried-as-illness-revealed-amid-ongoing-investigation-rumors-and-growing-past-controversies/articleshow/129988819.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/clavicular-suddenly-ends-livestream-leaving-fans-worried-as-illness-revealed-amid-ongoing-investigation-rumors-and-growing-past-controversies/articleshow/129988819.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-03T02:50:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129988815,imgsize-380199.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Who is Randy George? Pete Hegseth asks US army chief of staff general to step down]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129988771.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-randy-george-us-defence-secretary-pete-hegseth-asks-army-chief-of-staff-general-to-step-down/articleshow/129988771.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-randy-george-us-defence-secretary-pete-hegseth-asks-army-chief-of-staff-general-to-step-down/articleshow/129988771.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-03T02:46:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator 